#N canvas 100 100 1300 1200 12;
#X text 20 10 Song player. ockm-song-list <p r p r ...> sets the chain \, ockm-song-start <step> plays from a step \, ockm-song-loop 0/1. Counts bars: at the start of a step's last bar it queues the next pattern \, so it switches right on the pattern's end. Sends ockm-song-show <list> and ockm-song-pos <step> <bars left>.;
